Package: GPGHS
Type: Package
Title: Gaussian Process Group Horseshoe for Spatial Cell-Cell Interactions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates spatially varying cell-cell interaction networks in
    tissue imaging data. Each cell type's expression is regressed on every
    other cell type via a Hilbert Space Gaussian Process (HSGP) basis
    expansion with Matern smoothness, combined with a group horseshoe prior
    across neighbors for edge sparsity and a global half-Cauchy shrinkage
    parameter, fit via a Gibbs sampler. A faster backfitting-based
    alternative (gp_node()) is also provided for exploratory use.
